  "query_preview": "(Thursday through Sunday)...\nOn Thursday, there will only be slight changes in high\ntemperatures for most areas with inland Orange County and the\nInland Empire cooling a few to around 5 degrees. A low pressure\nsystem developing over the western states for Monday of next week\nwill bring a cooling trend for Friday through next weekend with \nhigh temperatures cooling a few to around 5 degrees on Friday and \nanother 4 to 8 degrees on Saturday and again on Sunday. High \ntemperatures on Sunday will be around 4 to 8 degrees below \naverage, ranging from the 70s near the coast to the lower to mid \n80s for the Inland Empire with the lower deserts in the lower to \nmid 90s.",
